    "excerpt": "The Mini Cooper turned Issigonis packaging into a sharper, faster and more credible sporting small car.",
    "content": "<p>The Mini Cooper was born when the small BMC car gained a sharper sporting purpose. The basic Mini already had the right foundations: low weight, compact size, front-wheel drive and direct reactions.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"/assets/images/autoretro/austin/Mini_cooper-knightsbridge.jpg\" alt=\"1964 competition Mini Cooper — contextual illustration\" title=\"1964 Mini Cooper\" width=\"400\" height=\"297\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" /><figcaption>Cooper development turned the Mini’s agility into genuine competition ability.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Practical final checks</h2>\n\n<p>The Cooper story begins with <a href=\"/en/auto-retro/austin/aventure-mini-austin.php?open_article=rencontre-john-cooper-mini#attached-article-rencontre-john-cooper-mini\">John Cooper</a>. Its rally proof appears in <a href=\"/en/auto-retro/austin/aventure-mini-austin.php?open_article=victoires-mini-rallye-monte-carlo#attached-article-victoires-mini-rallye-monte-carlo\">the Monte Carlo victories</a>.</p>\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.press.bmwgroup.com/global/article/detail/T0300116EN/1959-%E2%80%93-2019-sixty-years-of-mini?language=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BMW Group PressClub, 1959 - 2019. Sixty Years of MINI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.press.bmwgroup.com/ireland/article/detail/T0330396EN/classic-mini-timeline%3A-1959-2000?language=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BMW Group PressClub, Classic Mini Timeline: 1959 - 2000</a></li>\n</ul>",
